/*
 * VScript Function Wrappers
 * 
 * This file wraps all VScript functions to make them accessible via LookupFunction().
 * 
 * Background:
 * - C++ bound functions (userdata) cannot be found by LookupFunction()
 * - Only Squirrel-defined functions can be looked up by name
 * - This wrapper library solves this by wrapping all VScript functions in Squirrel functions
 * 
 * Usage:
 * 1. Load this file in your VScript: DoIncludeScript("vscript_wrappers.nut", getroottable())
 * 2. Access functions via API tables: CDirectorAPI.GetGameMode(), ConvarsAPI.GetFloat("sv_cheats"), etc.
 * 3. Use LookupFunction() to get function handles for SourcePawn
 * 
 * Auto-generated by generate_wrappers.py - Do not edit manually
 */

